## Why This Is Asked
This question introduces hands-on observability basics for SAP on AWS, covering log shipping, custom metrics, and alerting.

## Key Concepts
- CloudWatch Logs and CloudWatch Agent for centralized log management
- PutMetricData API for publishing custom metrics like SAP_CPU_GT_85
- CloudWatch Alarms for threshold-based alerting
- SNS for reliable notification delivery
- CloudFormation for Infrastructure as Code (IAM role and alarm creation)

## Code Example
```json
{
  "Resources": {
    "SAPCloudWatchLogsRole": {
      "Type": "AWS::IAM::Role",
      "Properties": {
        "AssumeRolePolicyDocument": {
          "Version": "2012-10-17",
          "Statement": [{
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Principal": {"Service": "ec2.amazonaws.com"},
            "Action": "sts:AssumeRole"
          }]
        },
        "ManagedPolicyArns": ["arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy"]
      }
    },
    "SAPCPUAlarm": {
      "Type": "AWS::CloudWatch::Alarm",
      "Properties": {
        "AlarmName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "MetricName": "SAP_CPU_GT_85",
        "Namespace": "SAP/Application",
        "Statistic": "Maximum",
        "Period": 300,
        "EvaluationPeriods": 1,
        "Threshold": 85,
        "ComparisonOperator": "GreaterThanThreshold",
        "AlarmActions": [{"Ref": "SAPSNSTopic"}],
        "TreatMissingData": "notBreaching"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
This tests end-to-end observability design for SAP on AWS, tying SAP metrics to AWS cost and performance signals, and validating the candidate's ability to implement a data plane, anomaly detection, and dashboards.

## Key Concepts
- SAP ABAP latency & HANA wait events
- OpenTelemetry + CloudWatch + S3
- SageMaker anomaly detection
- Lambda metric emission & custom metrics
- Cost-aware dashboards (QuickSight)

## Code Example

```javascript
// Minimal Lambda to emit a CloudWatch metric
const AWS = require('aws-sdk');
const cw = new AWS.CloudWatch();
exports.handler = async () => {
  const latency = await pingSAPAndMeasureLatency();
  await cw.putMetricData({
    Namespace: 'SAP/Observability',
    MetricData: [
      { MetricName: 'ABAP_RPC_Latency_ms', Value: latency, Unit: 'Milliseconds' }
    ]
  }).promise();
};
```

